    "SPHMC-RHO-CURVATURE": "p4.2 actual affine Hessian scaling gives 0 <= Hess rho <= eta I; genuine C2 refinements disclosed.",
    "SPHMC-STANDARDIZED-LAW": "p4.2 actual affine pushforward and proportional density are literal source; Jacobian/normalization cancellation retained as hidden analysis gap.",
